# radroots_transport_publish_protocol

## Quarantine status

This package is a retired, `publish = false` compatibility shim. New code must
use `radroots_protocol::radrootsd::transport_publish::v5`. It remains only for
the CLI and radrootsd consumers discovered during release-v1 migration. Step
286 removes the final radrootsd dependency and this package; it must not become
a registry identity or receive new behavior before then.

Shared Radrootsd transport publish JSON-RPC wire contracts.
